<title>DENMARK: GN STORE NORD UNIT IN C&amp;W TAKEOVER TALKS.</title>
<headline>GN STORE NORD UNIT IN C&amp;W TAKEOVER TALKS.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish cable and telecoms group GN Store Nord said on Wednesday its GN Comtext telex, fax and e-mail communications unit was in negotiations to acquire three Cable &amp; Wireless subsidiary companies.  </p>
<p>It said the three C&amp;W units in question were Bimcom's British and Greek operations, and Cable &amp; Wireless' Swiss and Italian fax communications divisions.</p>
<p>It gave no further details but said that further information would be released when or if a final deal was reached.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
